No anomaly! Go back, go back, go back, go back!

753
00:40:46,737 --> 00:40:49,537
え、やっぱ怖いよ、この人すれ違うと！
Whoa, it's still scary walking past this guy!

754
00:40:50,017 --> 00:40:52,917
まあ認めよう。お主の目が光るのは認めるが、
Well, I'll give you that. I'll accept your glowing eyes...

755
00:40:53,837 --> 00:40:56,797
認めるが、それにしても怖いのじゃ。
...I'll accept it, but even so, you're creepy.

756
