Isn't it obviously white?

802
00:43:05,597 --> 00:43:07,537
明らかになんか白くない？
Isn't there something obviously white?

803
00:43:09,657 --> 00:43:13,157
これ変じゃない？これ変だと…わしこれ異変だと思うな。
Isn't this weird? I think this is weird... I think this is an anomaly.

804
