This way. Yeah, I think this is an anomaly. Since I think this is an anomaly...

820
00:43:58,417 --> 00:43:59,237
進むわ。
...I'll go forward.

821
00:44:00,737 --> 00:44:01,837
のじゃ！
Right then!

822
00:44:02,517 --> 00:44:03,517
