I'm tired...

880
00:46:02,418 --> 00:46:07,138
何この人、大事なこと言いそうな空気出しといて大事なこと何も言わないっていう。
What's with this guy, acting like he's gonna say something important and then saying nothing at all.

881
00:46:10,138 --> 00:46:12,438
