何？
What?

885
00:46:22,458 --> 00:46:23,388
何？
What?

886
00:46:27,238 --> 00:46:27,888
寝た。
He fell asleep.

887
00:46:28,538 --> 00:46:30,288
立ったまま寝た。
He fell asleep standing up.

888
00:46:31,338 --> 00:46:32,988
立ったまま寝た、こいつ。
This guy fell asleep standing up.

889
00:46:33,958 --> 00:46:35,458
いち……えっ！？
