戻る！
Go back!

1229
01:02:32,742 --> 01:02:37,642
戻る戻る戻る戻る！戻るー！
Going back, going back, going back! Turning around!

1230
01:02:38,642 --> 01:02:39,942
なんもなかった。
Nothing was there.

1231
01:02:40,942 --> 01:02:42,242
神の車。
The blessed car.

1232
01:02:43,842 --> 01:02:45,042
行くのじゃ！
Let's go!

1233
01:02:46,042 --> 01:02:47,942
5！いいんじゃない？
Five! Looking good, right?

1234
01:02:48,542 --> 01:02:49,242
5！
Five!

1235
01:02:50,142 --> 01:02:51,042
ふんふんふん。
Hmm, hmm, hmm.

1236
01:02:52,942 --> 01:02:53,942
ふんふん。
Hmm, hmm.

1237
